    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2026-03-09",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Addressing Teacher Shortages Act of 2026</strong></p><p>This bill directs the Department of Education (ED) to establish an Addressing Teacher Shortages Program. Through this program, ED shall award grants for local educational agencies&nbsp;to address teacher shortage challenges.</p><p>Specifically, grant funds&nbsp;may be used to establish or expand teaching residency programs, teacher mentor programs, specified recruitment and training programs, and other evidence-based strategies to increase teacher retention and support teachers.</p>",
        "update_date": "2026-04-10T16:29:30Z"
      }
    ]
